[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0010","text":"嗯……嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0020","text":"呼——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0030","text":"哎呀，树里你怎么了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0040","text":"树里……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0003","text":"是不是累了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0004","text":"怎么\n了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_00_0005","text":"随时放马过来\n那种感觉？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_01_0010","text":"哇，没事吧……！？\n来这边坐……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_01_0020","text":"啥……不是啦！\n不过，谢了啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_02_0010","text":"嗯？\n只是想活动一下筋骨而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_02_0020","text":"也、也不用那么关注我吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_03_0010","text":"不错嘛，就是这股劲头！　树里！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03050000_03_0020","text":"你们把我当什么了！？"}]
